     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi all -<div><br></div><div>For those of you with the readPNG error, this error should be fixed in the devel version.  If you wouldn&#39;t mind, please recheck before I upload to CRAN with</div><div><br></div><div>library(devtools)</div><div>dev_mode()</div><div>install.packages(&#39;ggmap&#39;, username = &#39;dkahle&#39;)</div><div>library(ggmap)</div><div>qmap()</div><div><br></div><div>If you error on the install.packages part, don&#39;t worry - the problem is not with ggmap; you will be able to load it fine from CRAN once it&#39;s there just like any other package.  In that case, type sessionInfo() and you should notice either (1) ggmap_2.0 is not under &quot;other attached packages:&quot; or (2) it is, but the version is not 2.0.</div><div><br></div><div>If you <i>do</i> error, let me know what your sessionInfo() is.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers</div><div>david.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:se